      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5fca5df4d58780532024a52b|full_name}: When I was notified, the rules weren't updated. I even attached a screenshot of the page. The page itself even specifies when it was updated, which doesn't match the date on the GitHub. It may have been updated on there, but not on the actual page.\n\nThat's also specifically for the udon moderation tool guidelines, and not entirely about the topic at hand. That's simply one example that was cited here, and one example is already enough to ask for what other examples exist, not to ignore simply because one was made public after the fact. While the moderation guidelines massively damages communities, this precedent affects every player on VRChat.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
