      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The [Community Guidelines](https://hello.vrchat.com/community-guidelines) have been updated, and it now has a link to the new [Creator Guidelines](https://hello.vrchat.com/creator-guidelines).\n\nYou can read the announcement blog post here: https://hello.vrchat.com/blog/community-guidelines-update\n\nSo, this feature request can be closed.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
